  "LongDescription": "Radhuni Fried Rice Seasoning 48 gm (08X6 pcs) Fried rice is a popular dish around the world, celebrated for its versatility and delicious flavors. Whether you’re using leftover rice or whipping up a quick meal, the right seasoning mix can elevate your fried rice from ordinary to extraordinary. Radhuni, the pioneer in the spice market of Bangladesh, has introduced a Fried Rice Seasoning Mix with the assurance of authentic taste and flavor. It is developed with a unique shallot flavor giving true restaurant-style aroma and taste. Also, no added MSG gives it a healthy connection to daily life. Radhuni Fried Rice Seasoning Mix will add value to modern busy life through an oriental food experience with minimal effort at home.",
